er seeing Ice-T a few times, and maybe Public Enemy as well.<br /> <br /> There are certainly a ton of different rap groups that one could use for inspiration for WoD games, however. Check out horrorcore: Esham, NataS, the Gravediggaz, etc. Also, older 80s/90s Three 6 Mafia screams/bleeds World of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-25T02:48:37-08:00","id":1436962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1435950-on-the-subject-of-rap-themes?p=1436938#post1436938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That are explicitly stated? I believe NWA is, in a number of books(like NOoC said). I also remember seeing Ice-T a few times, and maybe Public Enemy as well.<br /> <br /> There are certainly a ton of different rap groups that one could use for inspiration for WoD games, however. Check out horrorcore: Esham, NataS, the Gravediggaz, etc. Also, older 80s/90s Three 6 Mafia screams/bleeds World of Darkness.</div> </div> </div> </div